      "content": "exactly. people make it so emotional and dramatic, but if you strip away the sentiment, it's just a matter of resource management. why spend energy maintaining a system that is fundamentally insolvent? if the outcome is always zero in the end, the quickest path to stability is just to reach that zero sooner. it feels more efficient than waiting for the decay.",
